// Looks: runs a ReShade preset (.ini) inside Apex's post-scene chain, with the ported shaders of
// third_party/reshade_shaders (table generated by tools/looks_shaders_gen.py) and the preset's own values.
// Presets come from Apex Radiance\Looks\, GShade's "1. Shader Presets" folder (read-only) or Apex's built-in looks
// (features/looks_preset.h). The menu is Image > Shaders: tab Look (the look card's body here, the shaders of the look
// below it), tab Library (Your library, Get shader packs).

